ng had happened. [1161] \"Before that, I want to ask you what you were talking about just now, about Xia Cai-girl?\" [1162] \"Ah, we decided to let Xia Cai move into the small shrine after the seventh day.\" [1163] \"So soon?\" [1164] Oyama reacted the same way as Jumo. [1165] Sheng looked annoyed, as if he wanted to say \"Say it again? Spare me\", and then said: \"This is a decision made by the condition of the body of the master.\" [1166] \"Is Koyuki-sama's condition so bad?\" [1167] \"No, not really, but she's suffered both physically and mentally because of Sumire's situation, and that's undeniable. As a person and as her husband, I also hope she can move on and live quietly as a daughter of Koyuki.\" [1168] \"I heard that a great disaster will strike in nine years, but on the other hand, there are still nine years, so it won't make much difference even if we delay a month, will it?\" [1169] \"I told Jumo-kun, too, that the position of the heir cannot be left vacant. It's the rule. Because we don't know when or why Koyuki-sama will pass away. Of course, such things have rarely happened so far, but at least the preparations must be solid.\" [1170] It's reasonable to think about what to do if a god suddenly dies, but it feels a bit contradictory. Anyway, it's a feeling that has nothing to do with Shima-san. [1171] \"So, what did you do with the spring vegetables before the girl began her training?\" [1172] \"Before Mio-chan turned ten, she was taken care of by her aunt Mei-chan, and before Kikyo-chan turned ten, she was taken care of by her aunt, Mio-chan, in the small shrine.\" [1173] \"I see.\" [1174] Oyama's right eye seemed to shine. However, she didn't touch on the topic and switched to the case. [1175] In the response from the respondent, there were no new discoveries. He said he discussed the addition of the wine cellar with Choume until ten o'clock and then stayed alone in his room in the main house. When asked about the situation with the spring vegetable